window.products.push({"id":1142104,"name":"OUTOS Mason Jar Solar Lids, 3 Pcs Solar Mason Jar Lids with LED Light Beads for Glass Mason Jar,Garden,Courtyard, Wedding, Party, Kids Room,Bar,Cafe L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LlA6T939L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Solar Mason Jar Lids Features: - Solar Mason Jar Lids:Diameter 7cm,can be added to most standard glass mason jars, put the jar to anywhere and decor you house. - Quick start: Turn on the switch, insert it on the top of the mason jar, and screw the lid. - Smart Light Sensor: When turn on the switch, the surrounding becomes dark the light will automatically turn on until the surrounding environment becomes bright. - High-quality Solar Panel: Fully-charged in 5-8 hours, and light on for 8-12 hours. Making Amazing Light Decorations and Reception Lighting 1,Creating beautiful solar garden lighting. 2,Solar pathway lighting. 3,Setting the perfect summer atmosphere on your patio. 4,Decorate a garden party. 5,Wedding decorations with a summer feel. Specification: Material: plastic Product Size: diameter 7cm Color: Warm White/Nature White/ColorfulPower: solar charge, each mason jar need an rechargeable 1 AAA battery (included) Battery voltage:1.2v, 600mah Switch type: Fluctuation switch Waterproof Class: IP65 Each Lid:10 LED Light mode:flicker Note: 1.Please allow a little size error due to manual measurement. 2.Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item. 3.If you receive the solar mason jar lid and find it is not bright, please put the lid under the sun for charging at first. Please Noticed this lid has an On/Off switch, turn the switch on before charging by solar.It need take 5-8 hours charging time in the sunshine, light up for about 8-12 hours when fully charged. 4.The solar panel is loose, this is not a product problem,it is a normal phenomenon.when the mason lid is installed in the mason jar,after tightening the lid,the solar panel will not loose again. Package includes: 3PCS*Solar Mason Jar Lid with LED Light(Manson Jar Not Included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LlA6T939L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OUTOS","source_asin":"B07211PGDC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07211PGDC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07211PGDC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
