window.products.push({"id":1142109,"name":"Rakemi Toilet Bowl Stainless Steel Brush Modern Bathroom Accessories Freestanding Cleaning Tools with Metal Handle,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514OCIBHRuL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Max. 2000 Bytes, spaces and HTML codes included. Tired of old and ugly toilet brushes that easily break? Something as small as a toilet brush can make or break your bathroom’s décor. Traditional scrubbers ruin your toilet with a stingy look. Exposed brush heads create an instant negative impression, and bulky ones draw the wrong kind of attention. Plastic toilet brushes bend, break or even melt when used with bleach or any other strong cleaning chemicals. This leads you to constantly replacing your toilet bowl scourers, and more unplanned expenses. Save yourself from unnecessary purchases with the durable Rakemi Stainless Steel Toilet Brush! Exquisite and compact, our stainless steel toilet brush and ball-shaped container set are designed to make anyone look twice whenever they walk into your bathroom. With a classy matte finish, a touch of white that complements any décor, and corrosion-resistant build that keeps rust at bay, it is sure to elevate your toilet’s charm. This toilet bowl scrubber is made of brushed stainless steel with a minimalist shape and looks to reciprocate any kind of decor. The round container keeps your brush out of sight for a dual purpose of tidiness and storage. Save time and effort in keeping your toilets clean. Our scouring tool’s strong brush head bristles thoroughly scrub your toilet bowl even when less pressure is applied. Need help to make up your mind? Here are additional benefits of our toilet cleaner set: ✔ Replaceable brush head ✔ Heavy-duty ball shaped container that prevents the brush from tipping over ✔ Ventilated holder prevents accelerated bacterial growth Keep your toilets looking divine all the time. Add the Rakemi Stainless Steel Toilet Brush to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514OCIBHRuL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rakemi Toilet Bowl Stainless Steel Brush Bathroom Accessories","source_asin":"B07QKN2TSL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QKN2TSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QKN2TSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
