window.products.push({"id":1142166,"name":"LINSY HOME 6 Drawer Dresser, Long Dresser for Bedroom, Chest of Drawers with Metal Handles, Ideal for Living Room, Entryway and Hallway, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i7MQXKusL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[PREMIUN MATERIAL] - Crafted with CARB P2 & TSCA certified eco-friendly manufactured wood. We care about your health. Exquisite sealing process gives the dresser a waterproof surface and smooth texture while making it long-lasting. [TIMELESS DESIGN] - Delicate wooden legs, framed drawer fronts and luxurious pull handles add appealing detail to this modern dresser. making it easy to adapt to any decorative style and creating a spacious look for your space. [AMPLE STORAGE SPACE] - With 6 spacious drawers, this dresser can organize anything from shirts and underwear to diaper and toys. Feel free to place it in your bedroom, nursery or anywhere you like. It can also be used as a TV stand. (Max. load capacity of the Tabletop: 66lbs) [STURDY STRUCTURE] - The bottom cross support structure and wooden frame make this 6 drawer dresser more stable and durable than others which will not deform after several years. Overall dimensions: 15.7\"D x 47.2\"W x 33.5\"H. [SAFETY FIRST] - Wall anchor kit provided to prevent tip-over incidents. Smooth metal runners on each drawer with safety stops prevent drawers from puling out. Hardware and ASSEMBLY instructions included. Electric Screwdriver & Two People Recommended. [SATISFACTION GUARANTEE ] - LINSY HOME dresser comes with lifetime customer service and 3-year warranty. If you have any question before or after purchase, our customer service is ready to help you within 24h.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i7MQXKusL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINSY HOME","source_asin":"B0B6W94TQF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6W94TQF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6W94TQF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1142167,"name":"Halloween Skull 6 Cavity Silicone Mold Baking Chocolate Candy Making Ice Cube Molds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61asNqBCnlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This silicone mold with skull-shaped cavities are perfect to make baked treats for Halloween. Get this silicone mold to bake adorable and festive pumpkin cakes and candies for your friends. You can decorate it with icing and sprinkles for some visual treat. Freeze ice into fun shapes for a party. Microwave, oven, freezer and dishwasher safe. Heat resistant up to 450°F (232°C) INSTRUCTIONS: Do not fill mold to top. Leave room for batter to rise as it bakes. Invert mold to remove baked goods and apply gentle pressure from the bottom while gently peeling the mold away. Never use sharp utensils on molds. For best results, spray the baking surface with non-stick spray. Heat resistant up to 450°F (232°C), durable to be placed in oven directly from the freezer. Baking time may vary from traditional bakeware and adjustments to time and temperature may be necessary. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Wash in hot soapy water. Avoid use of abrasive cleaners or scouring pads. Dry well before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61asNqBCnlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Celebrate It","source_asin":"B07XV5WQ6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XV5WQ6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XV5WQ6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
