window.products.push({"id":1142217,"name":"EpiqueOne 41-Piece Rose Gold 30th Birthday Decorations for Women | Includes Happy Birthday Banner, Cake Topper, Tissue Pom Poms & More | Easy to Set U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xAry2krbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LET'S GLITTER AND GLOW FOR THE BIG THREE-OH: Celebrate your 30th birthday in style with our stunning Rose Gold Birthday Decorations! Embrace turning thirty with this shimmering set featuring a contemporary color palette of rose gold, white, and silver, all adorned with glitter to make your big day sparkle. Boost your event with these refined, sophisticated, and stylish decorations. Each component, from balloons to banners, is crafted to enhance the ambiance of your milestone event. CHIC THAT BLENDS WITH ANY CELEBRATION: While ideally suited for a glamorous 30th birthday, these elegant decorations can also add sparkle to bridal showers, baby showers, wedding parties, and anniversary celebrations. Our all-inclusive decoration set creates a harmonic, yet chic ambiance that seamlessly blends with various themes, leaving an unforgettable impression on your guests. Transform your space and make your occasions extra memorable, with a touch of rose gold elegance! ONE-STOP-SHOP FOR ALL THINGS GLITZ AND GLAM: It includes 24 balloons in white, rose gold, and clear with rose gold confetti (8 each). You'll also find 8 tissue pompoms (4 white & 4 rose gold, varying sizes), a 6.5' rose gold glitter garland, a \"Happy Birthday\" banner with hanging string, and two mylar \"30\" balloons in Rose gold (32\" each). To cap it off, there's a rose gold glitter \"Happy 30th Birthday\" cake topper and two 6.5'x3.5' silver curtains. Note: pompom colors lighten upon fluffing. SIMPLE TO SET UP: Setting up our Rose Gold 30th Birthday Decorations is a breeze! With just a few minutes of fluffing tissue paper pom poms and hanging items using included strings or ribbons, your space will be party-ready. For added ease, assemble a day before the event. Inflate balloons with air or helium, using the provided straw and curling ribbon. Enjoy the simple setup process and effortlessly craft an elegant atmosphere for your unforgettable celebration! EXCELLENT VALUE FOR YOUR MONEY: EpiqueOne rose gold party decorations are not only easy to install and reusable, but the high-quality materials ensure they will last. Whether you're hosting a party or sprucing up your space, these pom poms are a cost-effective way to make a big impact without breaking the bank. The ability to mix and match colors and sizes provides endless possibilities for creating a customized look that will elevate your decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xAry2krbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EPIQUEONE","source_asin":"B07XFNTKSP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XFNTKSP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XFNTKSP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
