window.products.push({"id":1142248,"name":"COOL KNIGHT Electric Herb Grinder Electric Spice Grinder, USB Rechargeable 200W Cordless Electric Herb Grinder for Herbs, Spices, Seeds, etc. (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KtzKYOcaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Material and Wireless Electric Design】: USB interface charging, 1500mAh large-capacity battery realizes high-power and high rotational speed operation, and the blade is made of high-quality stainless steel, which is very durable. The unique shape of the blade allows three-dimensional grinding in a 360-degree direction, and it runs at 28,000 revolutions per minute, which enables the grinder to complete its work quickly and it is easy to carry. 【Powerful Multifunctional Grinder】: Spice grinder is suitable for grinding herbs, spices, pollen, pepper, coarse salt, etc., it can meet all your grinding needs, and solve slow grinding, low capacity, long grinding time, and inability to control the coarseness and so on, and at the same time help you solve the problem of outdoor grinding. 【Operation Steps and Safety Design】:1. Please prepare the material to be ground. 2. Unscrew the grinding cup and put vanilla inside. 3. Install the grinder upside down and clockwise on the glass (when the indicator light flashes blue 5 times to indicate that the glass is installed successfully) , and then please press and hold the switch for 3 seconds to start , the grinder will not start when the grinder cup is separated from the host, please rest assured to use it. 【Large-Capacity and High Rotational Speed Grinder】: equipped with a 200W powerful motor, which allows you to grind more finely and evenly each time. It can quickly grind 120g of medicinal materials or spices within 5-10 seconds; the visualized Borosilicate glass design allows you to see the whole process of grinding clearly, one-button start switch can make the grinding coarse and fine in your control, rough grinding takes 3 to 5 seconds, and fine grinding takes 8 to 15 seconds. 【Easy to Clean】: The removable grinding cup is easy to fill and clean. When the grinding is completed, please remove the glass， and just cleaning it with a cleaning brush is ok; you can also pour a small amount of water into the glass jar and start the grinder for a few seconds, it can start automatic cleaning (Note: Do not soak the main body of the grinder in water for cleaning except for the glass). 【After-Sales Serve】: If you are dissatisfied with them for any reason or encounter any trouble during use, please contact us in time. We will provide you with the best solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KtzKYOcaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COOL KNIGHT","source_asin":"B09M8B264K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M8B264K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M8B264K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
