window.products.push({"id":1142257,"name":"Western Kitchen Rugs and Mats Set of 2, Non-Skid Soft Absorbent Texas Star Kitchen Mats Set for Floor, Rustic Farmhouse Comfort Runner Rug Carpets for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HoQhpcubL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER ABSORBENT MATERIAL: Our Washable Kitchen Rugs Set with super absorbent plush microfiber can quickly absorb moisture and oil and dry instantly. It will still maintain its good standing as new and keep your floors clean and dry, protecting your kitchen floor from water damage. The comfort mats with low pile are soft to touch and its shaggy surface is ease and comfortable for bare feet to stand on it or better for pets to play on. NON-SLIP & PERFECT SIZE: Our heavy duty Non-skid kitchen mat set adopt high quality Non-Skid TPR bottom, keep water and moisture from seeping and stay in place on dry floor, won't slip or scuff floors, also ensure safety, fading and abrasion resistance. The set contains 2 rectangular rugs(16” x 24”+16”x47”). Low profile design and reinforced overlock edges ensures that doors won't get stuck or the door rug go curling. DURABLE, SAFE & FASHION: Durable Kitchen Runner Rug features the soft plush in stylish color patterns to match any décor harmoniously. The fine sewing technology & TPR rubber backing makes kitchen rugs and mats solid, durable and practical, no shedding. Eco-friendly and recyclable, perfect for homes with pets or kids. Ideal gifts for friends and family! EASY CARE & MACHINE WASHABLE: Kitchen Mats for floor is machine washable and can remove stains easily. Easy to clean, vacuum regularly or simply toss it into the washing machine with mild detergent in cold water and let it air dry. After multiple times machine wash test, the door mat is still as good as new. Don’t use softeners. VERSATILE & RISK-FREE: Kitchen Runner Carpet provides an extra large activity in kitchen, bathroom, laundry room, bedroom, office, by the sink, door entrance, patio entry ways, living room, balcony, porch, etc. The stylish design matches any décor. As kitchen mat, bathroom rug, bedside blanket, office mat, laundry mat, indoor doormat, runner, floor carpet, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HoQhpcubL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homechoid","source_asin":"B09TZM3Q5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TZM3Q5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TZM3Q5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1142258,"name":"Polder Dual Sensor Thermometer and Timer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31pmsv0GTnL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description 894-90RM Features: -Range: 32-572 degrees Fahrenheit.-Dual sensor in single probe.-Large and easy to read numbers.-Memory for frequently used settings. Amazon.com Versatility is the watchword with the Polder dual sensor thermometer and timer, which measures both the internal temperature of your food and the temperature of your oven at the same time. With its stacked temperature displays and 10-hour timer ( nine hours, 59 minutes, and 59 seconds, technically), the Polder thermometer is both functional and efficient. Its temperature readings range from 32 to 572 degrees F, though the temperature ranges for the pre-settable timer run from 85 to 572 degrees F (which is fine, as you'll rarely have to cook something at a temperature below 85 degrees). The timer is versatile, too, with count-down, count-up, and overtime count-up features. The thermometer even comes with a USDA cooking chart, with recommended temperatures and times for a variety of foods. --Rivers Janssen","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31pmsv0GTnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polder","source_asin":"B00006NWAD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006NWAD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006NWAD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
