window.products.push({"id":1142285,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Restaurant White Wine Glasses, Clear, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Gq8E4jCRL._AC_SL1323_.jpg","description":"The fine tradition of the Bormioli Rocco Group coincides with the very history of glass: the first glassworks was established in Parma in 1825. The company has always demonstrated a great drive to pioneer innovation: in machinery, materials and design. Over the years it has developed a special talent, that of combining time-honored craftsmanship and the passion of master glassmakers with modern industrial processes. Bormioli Rocco is the leading company in its sector in Italy and a great ambassador of the Made in Italy label on international markets. Respect for tradition, passion for good taste and constant research and innovation are Bormioli Rocco's milestones to create products that meet the needs of the consumers. For Bormioli Rocco the respect for the environment; it's a must so its entire manufacturing process is oriented towards a mission of social and environmental responsibility. The company's ideals are epitomized with the recently developed Star Glass. Star glass is an innovative material that delivers outstanding brilliance, typical of crystal, with the light and easy-to-use products. The new formulation guarantees the highest transparency of glass, eliminating shades and impurity, as the assessment of the wine color can be made without distortions, as well as for those looking for elegant and high quality glassware. Star Glass guarantees high resistance to wear and dishwashing, even under the heaviest duties, still being 100& recyclable and environmentally friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Gq8E4jCRL._AC_SL1323_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B00P7R54CU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P7R54CU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P7R54CU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
