window.products.push({"id":1142318,"name":"Tribesigns Nightstand Bedside Table with 2 Drawers, Modern End Table Small Side Table with Storage Shelves for Bedroom Living Room, Gold and White (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DwQi5vVNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stylish and Chic Nightstand: Complete your bedroom space with this modern nightstand! Crafted with laminated particle board and metal frame, sleek white wood grain offers a generous display surface while gold metal base adds sturdiness and modernity, easily match with other home decor style! Bedside Table for Bedroom Living Room: Crawl into bed and grab an interesting book from night table, or relax yourself and take a cup of coffee from side table, both of which can be completed with this small nightstand, practical for home daily use. Nightstand with 2 Drawers: This white nightstand features a smooth table top to place table lamp, 2 small drawers to secure your bedside essentials, and a bottom open shelf for books or small items. Solid Construction: This nightstand table is made of thick particle board and heavy-duty metal frame, durable enough for few years use. Easy to Assemble: All installation hardware tools and user manual help you effortlessly to install this beside table. We also provide professional customer service and a worry-free experience, and support free exchange for damaged and missing parts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DwQi5vVNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribesigns","source_asin":"B09JB95C74","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JB95C74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JB95C74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1142319,"name":"Jokari 7-Piece Healthy Steps Portion Control/Weight Loss Utensils Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RvqoQWBBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you've had it up to here with diets that just don't work maybe you should stop thinking \"diet\" and start thinking \"portion control.\" Jokari's Healthy Steps Portion Control Utensils Set is designed to take all the guesswork out of preparing properly portioned meals at home and help you to lose weight without measuring, weighing your food or counting calories. And, best of all, since portion sizes area discretely marked on the inside of each utensil's serving area no one will ever know that you're watching what you eat! Each set comes with a 3-piece serving set that includes a slotted spoon for vegetables, a solid serving spoon for starches like rice or potatoes and a protein server that's sized to represent a correct deck-of-cards-sized serving of meat or fish. There's also a collapsible silicone pasta basket in which to cook and strain a single serving of any type of pasta, a serving ladle marked for a proper serving of sauces, gravy or soup, a pasta server for dishing up just the right amount of pasta and sauce and a portion control salad dressing lid that fits most store-bought plastic dressing bottles and accurately dispenses one properly-sized serving of oil & vinegar types of dressing at a time. Just think . with Jokari's 7-Piece Healthy Steps Portion Control/Weight Loss Utensils Set you can actually eat everything on your plate and still feel good about it! For over 40 years, Jokari has held a special place in its heart for gadgets; today, they specialize in providing affordable solutions to common problems faced by consumers. From unique kitchen gadgets and household storage and organization solutions to their Healthy Steps kitchen tools designed to help with portion control and healthy eating, Jokari is committed to creating useful and often crazy looking \"thingamajigs\" that are fun, colorful and easy to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RvqoQWBBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jokari","source_asin":"B00INNXZVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00INNXZVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00INNXZVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
