window.products.push({"id":1142376,"name":"Homvare Christmas Holiday Placemats for Home Decoration Heat Resistant Washable - 13”x19”- Set of 4 - Scenery","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R6uDQ5VNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Holiday design: Add a festive touch to your holiday parties, Cocktails, Family Gatherings with the elegant Holiday Placemats. The placemats are designed to complement many decors and liven your favorite dinnerware from Fine Porcelain to casual dinnerware. Material: Tapestry placemat will add a touch of luxury and elegance to your dining table decor. Made with 68% Cotton 32% Polyester. Each Placemat is woven for detail pattern quality. Size: Add rustic charm with our Handcrafted Tapestry table linens. The heavyweight cotton construction of our set of 4 Placemats highlights beautiful woven silhouettes. 13\" x 19\". Appropriate for table that can seat 4-6 people Perfect gift: The artistry of handweaving is displayed in these heavyweight cotton placemats. Makes a great hostess gift to take with you during the busy holiday season. They are great addition for your airbnb, Cabin, Yacht, Vacation home or Private Jet. Easy Care: Give your table a delightful upgrade. These novelty cotton placemats are easy to take care of and are Machine washable. You can drop the Gravy, Meat Loaf, Turkey, Ketchup, Mustard, Curry, Maple Syrup or any of your favorite holiday feast and simply put them to your washing machine for easy cleaning, ready for next gathering.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R6uDQ5VNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homvare","source_asin":"B076VTN61P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076VTN61P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076VTN61P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1142377,"name":"Wooden Plates and Bowls Set Service for 4 (23pcs) - Wooden Salad Bowl Set and Round Acacia Serving Plates Dish. Wooden Dinnerware Set for All Occasion","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y+GSaZVeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Handmade from Acacia wood, this 23 pieces acacia wood salad bowl set preserves the simple elegance of the woodgrain and beautiful earthy tones decor of Acacia. Each piece is carefully crafted from solid wood making it durable and easy to maintain. From the natural wood material to the non-geometric design, these eco friendly products are all about bringing beauty from nature to your home in a unique and sustainable way. This versatile wood plates and bowls sets comes complete with wood spoon, small wooden bowls, wood bowls for food, wooden cutlery, wooden serving platter and is easy to carry. Adds a striking natural rustic look to any table setting. Perfect for all occasions. It’s a durable wooden serving set that you can use when you’re hosting dinner or a party and means you’ll always be prepared when guests arrive. This wood dinnerware set is unique and has many features and benefits such as: - Smooth and elegant wood work that has a great look and feel - Reusable and Eco-friendly - Safe and healthy to use for hot or cold food - Does not break or crack from use - Stylish – In a natural wooden finish that looks stunning and will make an attractive centrepiece on your table when entertaining - Easy to clean - A Natural and Renewable Wood - When you use fast-growing Acacia wood bowls, trays, plates and platters you are part of a sustainable journey that ensures less trees are felled The set includes: 1x Salad bowl large 9.84” x 3.93” (25cm x 10cm) 2x Utensils (1x spoon 1x fork) 10.47” (26cm) (Salad servers) 4x Salad bowl small 7.48” x 2.99” (19cm x 7.6cm) 4x Wood Plate 9.84 x 0.63” (25cm x 1.6cm) 4x Wood knives 7.87” (20cm) 4x Wood forks 7.87” (20cm) 4x Wood spoons 7.87” (20cm) Material: Acacia Wood Weight: 4.36kg Colour: Natural Wood Grain Washing Instructions: Wash with warm, soapy water and dry immediately. Do not soak in water. Do not put in a dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y+GSaZVeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09S2QL9PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S2QL9PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S2QL9PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
