window.products.push({"id":1142393,"name":"Portable Toilet for Camping, 15\" High Folding Commode Toilet Seat, Yoni Steam Seat, Emergency Porta Potty/Bathing Auxiliary Stool for Elderly, for Cam","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cn0A8LO8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅GO ON THE GO - When nature calls and you're out in the great outdoors, why shouldn't you get comfortable? VETIN's portable toilet makes your roughin' it experience feel like you're right at home! Make your bathroom experience less stressful, no matter where you are! ✅EASE TO STORE AND FOLD - Compact, portable camping toilets, this means that when on the road to or from your camping trip. This toilet chair takes up almost no space and is easy to store in your car, home, garage, boat, camper or trailer. Portable toilets great for emergencies and those places where there are no toilets and can be used in any out-of-view location. ✅MATERIAL - Made of Stainless Steel, rust resistance, and durability. Portable camping toilets on heavy-duty tubular steel legs, at just 3.7 pounds without the worry of breaking. Supports up to 330 lbs. At the base of each leg is a rubber stopper to prevent slipping. Bags are held in place by a removable plastic ring, you can relax in the time of emergency call of nature. ✅KEEP IT CLEAN - The portable toilet seat are completely covered by toilet lid, so you don't have to clean up a mess after every use. Use the toilet to replace the bag or bucket, which perfectly solves all your problems, and is always ready for accidents. SIZE: camping toilets portable 15.5\" * 15.5\" * 15\", it's the perfect height for comfortable sitting. You will get: bedside commodes*1, fixed silicone ring*1, biological bag*1 roll, toilet lid*1. ✅SUITABLE FOR ALL AGES - VETIN camping portable toilet is suitable for various ages. Unplanned calls of nature happen for everyone therefore solutions should be applicable for everyone. Use your portable commode for camping for long car trips, construction sites, fishing, hiking, outdoor living, park festivals, camping, Beach Nights, Trekking. Can be used at the bedside, as a separate bathroom, can also be used as a shower stool or steam seat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cn0A8LO8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VETIN","source_asin":"B091CH6R6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091CH6R6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091CH6R6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1142394,"name":"13 Piece Stainless Steel Family Cutlery Picnic Utensil Set with Travel Case for Camping | Hiking | BBQs - Includes Forks | Spoons | Knifes | Chopstick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91l-CUDNEXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CONVERTIBLE: Functions as a standalone display stand so cutlery is elevated in full view for easy utensil access. In a standing position, it also saves on space in tights spots with limited room. Neatly folds to transport eating utensils to your next event. DURABLE | RUGGED: Made with tough woven cotton and linen it protects your utensils from the elements, falls and has multiple compartments so flatware stays sturdy and doesn't clatter during transportation. FASHIONABLE | STYLISH: A contemporary design with a woven multicolored pattern it's sure to be a hit at your next boat ride, barbeque or camp. Blends in nicely with existing dinnerware décor and adds a vibrant splash of color to your spread no matter what the occasion. PORTABLE | TRAVEL FRIENDLY: Perfect for family outings to the Beach, Park or picnic and camping. Folded, the pouch measures 9.5\" x 5\"x 1\" and fits neatly into travel luggage or it can be hand held (Built in handle). DISWASHER SAFE: Cleans easily and is washer friendly. Simply wash, dry and reload the kit, and you are on your way. Item stores away easily in closets, Bins or it can be used as a drawer liner. THE ULTIMATE CUTLERY TRAVEL KIT AND SILVERWARE STAND! Our cutlery holder is the perfect roadside companion for traveling, no matter the occasion. The kit opens up and locks into place, and it creates an awesome utensil display stand for your table spread. ORGANIZATION: Each fork, spoon or knife sits neatly in its own secure compartment for easy access. In a vertical position, not only is the silverware more visible; it also adds a lovely colored accent and enhances the appeal of your picnic or party table. FEATURES: WEATHER RESISTANT SHELL CASE. It can be placed next to, or directly exposed to water as it provides layered protection for silverware. In the case of a fall, a woven nylon outer shell casing will prevent your cutlery from getting scratched, marred or disfigured. The case also protects your cutlery from moisture and liquids so they stay dry. SPACE SAVER | STORAGE ORGANIZER The pouch takes up minimal space in your rucksack, glove compartment, or luggage carrier. Saves on essential room in tight areas, and it makes for an awesome centerpiece. Holds all your silverware in one location for easy retrieval of your eating utensils. -Convertible - Stand | Travel Pouch -Individual cutlery compartments -Clatter Proof -Portable - Unfolded: L14.5\" x W9\" INCLUDES: - 1 Cutlery Storage Case with Handle - 4 Forks - 4 Spoons - 4 knives - 1 Pair of Chopsticks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91l-CUDNEXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wealers","source_asin":"B09B1BB9MG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B1BB9MG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B1BB9MG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
