window.products.push({"id":1142463,"name":"Grow Forward Premium Wheat Straw Cups - 20 oz Eco Friendly Alternative to Plastic Drinking Cups - Set of 8 Unbreakable Kitchen Cups - Reusable Plastic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719vtOreKWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Aqua Set of 8 Wheat Straw Cups ] - Reimagine the daily act of drinking water as a modern movement toward environmental sustainability. With purposeful design, our wheat straw tumbler cups dazzle with a cool aqua blue colorway; a nod to endangered ocean habitats. [ Environmentally Friendly Plastic Alternative ] - Reduce environmental impact by using wheat straw plastic drinking glasses. Thanks to advancements in green technologies and materials science, our BPA-free products are cleaner, safer, more durable, and less impactful. [ Unbreakable / Lightweight / Stackable ] - Unlike glass drinking cups or ceramic or acrylic cups, our wheat straw plastic tumblers are shatterproof and unbreakable. Custom designed with improved thickness, easy to grip and grasp, and perfectly stackable for small storage spaces. [ 20 oz Dazzling Blue Ocean Theme ] - 6 inches tall with extra volume. Use wheat plastic glasses cups for kitchen or outdoor drinkware for camping, picnic, patio, pool, parties, and events. The beautiful blue hues pair perfectly with the unique natural look of real wheat straw material. [ Earth Conscious / Planet Friendly ] - At Grow Forward, we make sure our eco-friendly products are always good for the Earth. The green production of wheat straw products releases less CO2 and requires less energy, with no need to cut down forests or further alter natural ecosystems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719vtOreKWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grow Forward","source_asin":"B0B1BMXKQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1BMXKQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1BMXKQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1142464,"name":"Osti (Steel) OSTI-822-US Cheese slicer Handheld Double wire stainless steel cutter for thin and thick slices, semi-hard or semi-soft block cheese Dish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZZohN1-KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In love with cheese? Add a Danish Classic to your kitchen and your cheese board: The Osti double-stringed cheese slicer was invented by Danish Osti in 1963. Coveted for its classic simplicity, the Osti cheese slicers have since become a household icon for cheese aficionados throughout the world. The all-stainless steel Osti 822 lets you cut both thick and thin slices (5/32”+5/64”) in one. Made from sturdy stainless steel with an elegant, brushed handle, the Osti 822 adds contemporary Danish design to your kitchen and your dining table. Handle a broad variety of semi-hard and semi-soft cheese with ease, including Cheddar, Monterey Jack, Provolone, Swiss Cheese, Gouda, Muenster and many more – and give that extra dash of Danish Design to your cheese board. The built-in cheese fork elegantly lets you lift and place the freshly cut cheese slices. The Osti 822 goes directly in the dishwasher, and is suitable for both kids and grown-ups, letting the whole family enjoy cheese the way it’s meant to: At Osti we know that freshly sliced cheese just tastes better. Whether for cherishing your cheese board, prepping your picnic, going upscale on your get-together or simply enjoying cheese, you will not go wrong with the Osti 822.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZZohN1-KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Osti","source_asin":"B06XS4VLDJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XS4VLDJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XS4VLDJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
