window.products.push({"id":1142489,"name":"HOMBCK King Platform Bed Frame with LED Headboard, Upholstered Bed Frame with Adjustable Headboard, Faux Leather King Bed Frame No Box Spring Needed, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k7a3yWdpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Modern Platform Bed Frame】: Designed in popular modern style, this king bed frame can be incorporated into any decor. The classic faux leather headboard with led lights blends seamlessly with any interior furniture. The complete headboard is designed to fit the body better and you won't feel tired when lying on the complete bed frame. 【Adjustable Faux Leather LED Headboard】: This king size bed frame comes with a height-adjustable headboard that can be adjusted to different heights according to individual needs. At the same time, the king bed frame imitation leather material is not easily damaged, and even if the bed frame with headboard is used for children, there is no trouble with daily cleaning. 【Sturdy Constructions Bed Frame】: The king bed is made of a combination of high-quality wood and metal, and the reinforced and thickened legs ensure that it will not bend easily. The king platform bed frame's provide extra stability through the wooden frame and also ensure that the mattress is not easily damaged. 【Noise-Free & Under Bed Storage】: When you rest on the king bed frame with headboard, it won't make noise easily and ensure the quality of sleep. At the same time, you also get king under-bed storage space that can hold some daily necessities and help you optimize your bedroom layout. 【Easy Assemble & 24 H Customer Service】: All the parts and tools are marked out and you only need to assemble them step by step according to the instructions, which is a very easy task. If you have any problems in the assembly or use, please feel free to contact us, we will provide you with 24 hours professional customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k7a3yWdpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMBCK","source_asin":"B0BSLDJ37X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSLDJ37X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSLDJ37X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1142490,"name":"Logicfox Ergonomic Office Chair, Breathable Ergonomic Chair with Comfortable Thick Cushion, Adjustable Lumbar Support and Headrest, Adjustable 3D PU A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tVAW9BcaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Breathable Mesh Back & Comfortable Thick Sponge Seat】- This ergonomic office chair comes with a sturdy mesh backrest, which gives your back a cool feeling. The front edge of the seat cushion is designed as ergonomic saddle-shaped to ensure that leg pressure is minimized during a long period of seating. The comfortable high-density sponge has up to 2 inches thick to ensure soft and not easily deformed. 【Adjustable 3D Armrests & Ergonomic Multi-functional Adjustment】- The saddle-shaped seat with highly elastic mesh meets the requirements of an ergonomic mesh office chair. This ergonomic office chair with multi-functional adjustments. It is a high back desk chair with a height adjustable headrest & lumbar support. This ergonomic chair is paired with adjustable 3D armrests that can adjust toward the front & rear, up & down and rotation. It can relieve the pressure on your hands and shoulders. 【Synchronous Multi-functional Mechanism & Reclining Adjust】- This office desk chair has a smooth recline with 3 lockable positions and up to 40° seat tilt range. The mechanical steel thickened multifunctional chassis, single lever control chassis lift, and back tilt give your body a comfortable adjustment. There will be a certain degree of tilt space adjustment when locking. Our comfortable office chair is simple and convenient to use. 【Premium Quality Assurance】- In order to give greater stability and strength, the office desk chair comes with a polished heavy-duty aluminum base, durable PU wheels, and a class-3 gas lift. 360-degree rotating castors that are smooth and silent. It will not scratch the floor. The mesh office chair is certified by BIFMA and SGS and it has a max capacity of up to 330 lbs 【Easy to Install & 3 Years Warranty】- If you have any questions about product quality, please feel free to contact us. This Logicfox office desk chair can be easily installed in 15 minutes. It is covered by a Logicfox 3-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tVAW9BcaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Logicfox","source_asin":"B0B5Q6PYZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5Q6PYZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5Q6PYZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1142491,"name":"Bluetooth Musical Christmas Snow Globes,Princess Snow Globes for Girls,Snow Globes for Daughter,Resin Snow Globe for Women,Snow Globe Ornament,Snow Gl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yMYx5kLZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Timer function】Bought for my daughters 6th birthday / she is a princess lover to say the least... the music has a wide variation of many piano melodies and the glitter snow in the musical snow globes for girls constantly swirls and lights up, at a constant. It’s a great gift !the snow globes musical has a timer that it would shut off after 6 hours. Overall, this was my daughters favorite gift turning 6 - highly recommended! 【2 lighting modes】My daughter has been asking for a snow globe for a while. She loves princess.The snow globe is so beautiful. The music is so pretty and the snowflakes inside will spin makes it just magical. I found that the switch can control the snowflakes to just spin without music, or to make the snowflakes spin while playing music.My daughter turns it on before she goes to bed at night and loves looking at princess snow globes. She is 9. I hope my daughter will have for years to come! 【Two power supply methods】Got this musical snow globes for a gift for friends and they really liked it. There are two ways to power snow globes. One is to supply power by connecting a USB cable. A USB cable is included in the box. The other is that it requires 3 AA batteries for power. AA batteries need to be purchased by ourselves. The snow globes for friends had a nice sound with pretty lights. The recipient was very happy. 【Gift】Purchased for my granddaughter after Checking out these beautiful picture. A beautiful snow globe! And, she loved it!! Didn’t care that it was loud. Music, glitter swirling, warm color, loud music, and, of course, the Princess!!! How could she not love this snow globes musical!! A great purchase for gift. 【Bluetooth Music】 Snow Globe can be connected to Bluetooth of mobile phones, tablets and other devices. Long press the silver metal nameplate on the Snow Globe base to turn Bluetooth on or off. After the Bluetooth connection is successful, you can play the music you like to listen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yMYx5kLZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DGSCAK","source_asin":"B09PY917M7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PY917M7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PY917M7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
