window.products.push({"id":1142530,"name":"Magnetic Knife Strip or Holder - Wood Knife Rack or Knife Bar with Hardware for Hanging & Wall Mounting. Kitchen Utensil Organizer & Storage by Fiddle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j+6GKlyDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing Your Ideal Storage SolutionRethink knife blocks or drawers that not only take up valuable space but also tend to nick knives and cause skin-slicing accidents. Opt for smarter storage with Fiddle & Finch! Crafted with warm beechwood and featuring a handsome, laser-etched pattern, your knife strip offers trendy, convenient, and secure organization.Inside Your Complete KitYour magnetic knife bar set includes:– 1 magnet knife holder with 18 magnets– 2 drywall screw anchors– 2 screws– Mini spirit level– Detailed installation instructions– A welcome note from us to you.A Bunch of BenefitsYour rack’s design provides a number of perks, including:– Easy to Clean: Notice a smudge or splatter on your magnetic utensil holder? Simply dampen a cloth and wipe your holder clean.– Fashionable: With its classic wood and an eye-catching pattern, your strip complements decor.– Durable: Your wood magnetic knife holder is especially resilient thanks to its food-safe wax coating.– Versatile: Systemize your kitchen, garage, child’s room, craft room, and more. Your wall knife holder hangs up to 5 lbs. of magnetic items from utensils to toys.– Installs in Minutes: No need to stress over hanging your heavy duty magnetic strip. Just gather your included hanging hardware, a drill, and a pencil, and follow our step-by-step instructions.The search for perfect knife storage is over. Elevate your kitchen organization with a magnetic knife strip from Fiddle & Finch!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j+6GKlyDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fiddle & Finch","source_asin":"B0B85SJBG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B85SJBG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B85SJBG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1142531,"name":"Coolnice 2 Pack Shower Caddy Shelf Organizer Aluminum Rectangle Shower Shelf with 4 Hooks Wall Mount Bathroom Shelf for Bathroom Toilet Kitchen No Nee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fknTKPRTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polished High-quality materials: Coolnice shower caddy shelf completely made of high-quality aviation aluminum, high strength, wear resistance, rust and corrosion resistance. long lasting. The surface of the bathroom shower shelf is polished, smooth and delicate, with round corners, which helps prevent injuries and is safe and durable. Strong load-bearing capacity: super load-bearing, according to the load-bearing test, the maximum load-bearing capacity is 40 pounds. It can store heavy items, such as large-capacity shampoo and shower gel, and can hold a variety of toiletries. Each shower shelf of the bathroom is equipped with 2 removable hooks for hanging towels, bath balls, etc., which is easy to use. Hollow design: The hollow design of the wall mount bathroom shelf prevents water accumulation and keeps it dry. The installation distance of the shower caddy organizer can be freely controlled according to actual needs without restriction. The rectangle shower shelf is suitable for flat walls. Two installation methods are simple and quick: Coolnice rustproof bathroom shelf organizer is equipped with screws and glue, and you can choose drilling or adhesive installation. Note: Adhesive installation is suitable for smooth, hard surfaces, such as tiles, smooth marble, glass, metal and solid wood. Multifunctional storage, saving space: Three colors available.Shower caddy shelf with hooks can be used to expand your storage space and organize items in the bathroom and kitchen. Suitable for bathroom, bathtub, washbasin, toilet, cabinet, balcony, living room, laundry room, toilet or kitchen, etc. This bathroom shower shelf corner can protect your items from falling off the shelf.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fknTKPRTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coolnice","source_asin":"B09N6ZL22Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N6ZL22Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N6ZL22Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
