window.products.push({"id":1142795,"name":"C&S Event Supply Co. 1.5 Oz Silver Sauce Cups - Strong & Durable Stainless Steel - Stackable & Reusable - Dipping Bowls for Condiments - Containers fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k0G-uWjLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sauce Cups: Serve those delicious dips and dressings with these 1.5 oz silver condiment cups that are perfect for serving gravy, BBQ, butter, yogurt, cream, honey mustard, ketchup, and signature sauce. These dipping sauce cups provide a simple, cost-effective way to serve necessary condiments to your guests and are a great alternative to wasting disposable sauce dipping cups. Premium Quality Material: These sauce cups are made of premium food-grade stainless steel materials that are reusable and provide a simple, clean presentation in your casual dining area. The condiments containers are durable, super strong, and longtime lasting, compared with other ceramic ones. These sauce cups reusable are versatile, not easy to break, rot or fade, and ideal for holding hot and cold sauces. Stackable Design: You can rely on this stainless steel sauce cup to be both an attractive and efficient addition to your dining establishment. Simply stack this dip cup to instantly expand your collection without sacrificing quality and convenience! You will receive 12 or 24 pieces of silver sauce bowls, and the abundant quantity can meet your use and replacement in daily life. Easy to Clean: These stainless steel condiment containers featured a rounded rim at the top which is safe and easy to clean. The stainless steel sauce cup has a smooth surface that resists corrosion and makes it reusable. Condiment cups reusable can be washed in the dishwasher so that condiments and sauces come right off. Wide Usage: The stainless steel cups allow you to hold condiments, vinegar, butter, ice cubes, nuts, ketchup & honey. Use these round dipping bowls in your casual restaurant, home gatherings, weddings, buffet, holiday parties, birthdays, home kitchens, restaurants, coffee shops, camping, or bar by pairing it with a matching fry cup for a simple, classic presentation. Sauce cup can also serve sides of salsa, fresh jalapenos, olives, or syrup in addition to your traditional signature sauces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k0G-uWjLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C&S Event Supply Co.","source_asin":"B0BSVNVRQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSVNVRQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSVNVRQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
