window.products.push({"id":1142810,"name":"Immanuel Cristal 4-PIECE Bathroom Accessory Set with Tumbler, Toothbrush Holder, Lotion Dispenser and Soap Dish (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VG5aqiWNL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"The crystal 4-piece bathroom accessory set adds a luxurious final touch to any bathroom. Accented with sparkling studded crystals, this elegant set is both stunning and functional. The set includes a soap/lotion dispenser, soap dish, tumbler and toothbrush holder. Manufactured from high quality ABS and acrylic for long-lasting use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VG5aqiWNL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IMMANUEL","source_asin":"B077YVHDQ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077YVHDQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077YVHDQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1142811,"name":"Yaheetech 6ft Pre-lit Artificial Christmas Tree Hinged Spruce Pencil Tree Corner Xmas Tree with 250 Warm Lights & Foldable Stand Holiday Decoration, G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g4dGMU0iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Quality Material】Get into the holiday joy with this lush pre-lit artificial Christmas tree. All branches and tips are made of premium PVC, which makes them harmless and durable. Both trunk and the stand are made of iron, ensuring sturdy and balanced placing, not to mention other feathers such as fire-resistant and anti-collapse. 【Clear Warm Lights】Our Christmas tree has ample incandescent warm white lights so you do not need to add extra lights. Place this artificial tree in front of the house or the garden, and let it shine all night in the worth-celebrating festival. 【Foldable Stand】This stand is foldable for easy storage and packing, you can effortlessly fold it to save more space in the garage and wait for another coming year. Four feet of the stand are covered by rubber each to make sure the tree is sturdy, also preventing floor scratches. 【Flexible Tips】The “leaves” on our tree can be bent and set at will. After putting the tree body and the stand together, you are supposed to fluff out the tips to give a full look at your unique Christmas tree. All tips are bendable and can be set in a certain direction, normally the fluffing out procedure includes two steps: lifting the top tips and pulling out the side tips. 【Versatile Design】Our pre-lit pencil artificial tree can be used either indoors or outdoors, the sturdy metal frame is relatively heavier and not likely to collapse. Pencil-shaped Christmas tree takes less room, suitable for places where the space is limited. It is a pre-lit tree with no decoration on it except for branch tips and warm lights. We hope you can enjoy a sweet fun time decorating this full and fluffy tree with your family and beloved ones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g4dGMU0iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yaheetech","source_asin":"B09MLG5N96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MLG5N96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MLG5N96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1142812,"name":"Cocktail Smoker Kit with Torch, Stainless Steel Ice cubes - Infuse the Aroma of 6 Kinds of Wood Chips in Whiskey, Bourbon, Cocktails, Wine, Cheese, Sa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FrvswaGzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🥃【LIGHT IT UP: SMOKIN' COCKTAILS WITH THE OLD FASHIONED COCKTAIL KIT 】🍷: The whiskey smoker kit is a product designed for mixology and cocktail lovers, providing an easy-to-use smoke infusion for your drinks. Whether you're a professional bartender or just someone who loves to experiment with new drink recipes. With its wooden infuser chimney and torch (no butane), you can easily add a touch of smoke to your favorite drinks 🪵【WOOD YOU LIKE SOME SMOKY FLAVOR IN YOUR DRINK?】🔥: You know what they say, \"variety is the spice of life.\" Well, with the drink smoker infuser kit's six different flavor wood chips (Pear Oak Apple Beech Cherry Hickory), you'll have enough variety to spice up your drinks for weeks! Who needs a boring old vodka soda when you can have a smoked pear and hickory-infused gin fizz? 🎁【THE BOURBON SMOKER KIT: THE GIFT THAT KEEPS ON DRINKIN'】👨: If you're looking for a gift that's both practical and fun, drink smoker for whiskey is the way to go. It's perfect for anyone who loves mixology or just enjoys a good drink (which, let's be honest, is pretty much everyone). Plus, it's a great conversation starter at parties, because who doesn't love talking about their favorite cocktails? 🧊【ICE, ICE, BABY: STAINLESS STEEL CUBES KEEP YOUR DRINK CHILL】🥶: Say goodbye to watery drinks forever, thanks to the cocktail smoker's six stainless steel ice cubes. These bad boys will keep your drink perfectly chilled without diluting it, which is a win-win situation. It's like having your cake and eating it too, except with drinks and ice cubes. 👍【SMOKE 'EM IF YOU GOT 'EM: EASY-TO-USE COCKTAIL SMOKER】❤️: Don't be intimidated by the smoked old fashioned kit's sleek design and fancy-sounding name. It's actually incredibly easy to use, even if you've never smoked a drink in your life. Just load up the wood chips, light the torch, and voila! You've got yourself a smoky cocktail that'll make you feel like a true mixologist.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FrvswaGzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIPIPIP","source_asin":"B0BLSBCP8R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLSBCP8R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLSBCP8R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
