window.products.push({"id":1142904,"name":"ZICOOLER 30\" Tower Fan, Large Airflow 70° Oscillating Fan with Remote, 32dB Quiet Fan with 3 Modes, 7.5H Timer, 3 Speeds, Cooling Fan for Bedroom, Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q9KzQf9LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Powerful: Advanced Scroll Spiral Duct】The upgraded vortex spiral duct features involute diffusion acceleration duct technology, which effectively improves air supply efficiency, brings greater air volume and wider air supply range. With 3 adjustable wind speeds, this tower fan fully meets your diverse needs. The low-grade wind is gentle and delicate, the mid-grade wind provides natural coolness, and the high-grade wind brings a super instant cooling effect. 【3 Customized Wind Modes to Meet Your Needs】This cooling fan has 3 modes (normal, natural, and sleep wind) that fully meet your multiple air circulation needs, bringing you various ways of cooling in summer. Normal wind mode quickly dispels summer heat and accelerates indoor and outdoor ventilation. Natural wind mode allows you to enjoy the breeze of nature at home. Sleep wind mode delivers gentle air, which is not easy for you to catch a cold and gives you a comfortable sleeping environment. 【32dB Low Noise for Quiet and Pleasant Cooling】Zicooler standing fan for bedroom features advanced low-noise technology, so you can enjoy peace and comfort with this quiet fan all day long. With 32dB low noise, you can enjoy quiet and pleasant coolness whether you are working or sleeping. The 7.5-hour timer helps you save energy while you sleep and provides you with silent care, allowing you to fully enjoy a deep sleep. 【Widespread Coolness: 70° Oscillation and 20ft Remote】The flexible 70° rotating design of oscillating fan gives you a wide-angle air supply that deeply promotes indoor air circulation and brings coolness to every corner of the room. Even airflow distribution and constant, fresh natural wind keep you comfortable throughout hot days. The 20ft remote control allows you to achieve all operations with just touch, bringing you convenience. 【Safeguarding Design】This 30-inch room fan can work safely without supervision. Every detail of this fan has been carefully considered for your safety, from the narrow air outlet that protects children to the steady base that resists falls and tripping, as well as the distinctive fused safety plug that prevents damage from over-voltage and power surges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q9KzQf9LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZICOOLER","source_asin":"B0C23J646T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1142904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C23J646T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C23J646T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
